---
title: Matcha latte
published: 2026-10-01
description: Matcha whisked with hot water, then topped up with oat milk.
tags: [Matcha, Latte, Recipe]
seriesOrder: 2
servings: 1
time: 5 min
difficulty: easy
---

Sift @matcha{2%g} into the #chawan{}.

Add @water{60%ml} at 80 °C, then whisk with the #chasen{} for ~{30%s}, until a fine foam forms.

Heat @oat milk{180%ml} and gently pour it over the matcha.

Sweeten with @maple syrup{1%tsp} if desired.
